File name: SFGHLOOP.MP
Path description: Shadowfist Temple (hidden areas only)
Path starts: Shadowfist Temple, Great Hall.
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 5
Level recommendation: 20-30
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: dark monk, dark apprentice, dark mystic.
Additional information:

This file uses a custom start point which I don't yet have files to and
from. However, these should be available soon.

To roam this area properly you need to be criminal or worse (villain,
fiend). Also, you need to go to Game Data -> Monsters, and set dark monks,
dark mystics and dark apprentices as 'Enemy' (if they aren't already),
and check the box 'Non-hostile'. Then go to Settings -> Combat, and check
the option 'Attack all monsters' if it isn't already checked. These things
will enable MegaMud to rest while there are still monsters in the room
(because when you are criminal or worse dark monks are neutral to you),
thus increasing your rate alot.

